===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|ang}} {{m|gem-pro|*gabulą||tribute}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{m|ine-pro|*ghab(h)-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*gheb(h)-||to take, give, transfer}}. Cognate with {{etyl|non|-}} {{term|gǫfga||to worship, offer|lang=non|sc=Latinx}}, {{etyl|got|-}} {{term|𐌲𐌰𐌱𐌴𐌹||tr=gabei|riches|lang=got}}, {{etyl|la|-}} {{m|la|habeō||to own, possess, have}}. More at {{l|en|give}}.

